Third-party material
--------------------

engine/xmage/
  The sidecar image clones XMage (https://github.com/magefree/mage) at the
  tag and commit in engine/xmage/XMAGE_TAG and applies the patches in
  engine/xmage/patches/. XMage is under the MIT License, copyright its
  authors.

Local data, not shipped in this repository
------------------------------------------

data/popularity/
  Brawl and Competitive Brawl popularity exports from Untapped.gg
  (https://mtga.untapped.gg). The repository does not ship these files. The
  maintainer keeps them locally, and git ignores them. The MIT License does
  not cover these files. They stay under the Untapped.gg terms of use.

Data fetched at ingest, not shipped in this repository
------------------------------------------------------

- Card data and Oracle Tags from Scryfall (https://scryfall.com), under the
  Scryfall API terms.
- The Magic: The Gathering Comprehensive Rules from Wizards of the Coast
  (https://magic.wizards.com/en/rules).

